OL,3,CFarm loses over #50,000 on crop yield
OL,4,Cas a result of heatwaves
OL,6,FWith Wales seeing about 5% of the
OL,7,Faverage rainfall for July with no
OL,8,Fsignificant wet conditions on the
OL,9,Fhorizon, our Rural Affairs and Climate
OL,10,FCorrespondent Hannah Thomas reports on
OL,11,Fthe long-term impacts of the dry spell.
OL,13,FMuch of Wales is in drought, or
OL,14,Fprolonged dry weather status following
OL,15,Flong spells of excessive heat,
OL,16,Fwidespread wildfires, and record-low
OL,17,Friver levels and it is having an
OL,18,Fimpact.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/4
