OL,3,CFarm loses over #50,000 on crop yield
OL,4,Cas a result of heatwaves
OL,6,FUsk, in Monmouthshire, has experienced
OL,7,F20 consecutive days of heatwave which
OL,8,Fbeats the previous Welsh record from
OL,9,Fthe summer of 1976.
OL,11,FGareth Williams, a farmer at Raglan
OL,12,FFarm Park, said it has been the lowest
OL,13,Fcrop-yield he has ever seen and that
OL,14,Fthe farm has lost #54,000 this year as
OL,15,Fa result of the weather.
OL,17,FGareth describes the financial loss as
OL,18,F"crucifying" and said he is worried
OL,19,Fabout how the farm will cope.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/4
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
