PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1785352729
OL,3,CFarm loses over #50,000 on crop yield
OL,4,Cas a result of heatwaves
OL,6,FHe said: "I have been farming all of
OL,7,Fmy life and we have always drawn a lot
OL,8,Fof corn, but I can never remember it
OL,9,Fbeing like this.
OL,11,F"It's just been so dry for so long".
OL,13,FHe expects customers will see an
OL,14,Finflation in prices, especially for
OL,15,Fwheat and oat based products like
OL,16,Fbread and porridge, due to the
OL,17,Fshrivelled grains and lower yields.
OL,19,FNatural Resources Wales (NRW) has
OL,20,Fpreviously confirmed which areas are
OL,21,Fin drought status:
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/4
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
