PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F433A1785352729
OL,3,CFarm loses over #50,000 on crop yield
OL,4,Cas a result of heatwaves
OL,6,FAccording to the National Drought
OL,7,FMitigation Centre, a drought is 'a
OL,8,Fprotracted period of deficient
OL,9,Fprecipitation resulting in extensive
OL,10,Fdamage to crops, and a consequential
OL,11,Floss of yield'.
OL,13,FThe remaining areas in Wales have
OL,14,Fentered prolonged dry weather status,
OL,15,Fincluding Usk.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/4
